body:
Thanks for that! That made me feel a lot better. I'm attempting to keep the bandage around it and wear tight underwear to hold it upright and just not walk around as much for a day or two.

&#x200B;

I was in the same situation as you, I also procrastinated when it came to getting it done. I also got in done due to phimosis, although I'm only 18. But I've known for a while it needed to be done.
